WEBVTT

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:12.920
This is good!

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:21.940
I'll clean up the room.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.200
I see.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.440
Naruto has been using it for three years.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:27.440
It's shiny.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.980
I'm ready to hit you.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:09.740
Iroge no Jutsu no Bon-Kyu-Pon!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:11.280
Hmph!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.170
This Hamaru...

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.800
I'm not a kid anymore!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.900
You seem to be doing that kind of Jutsu, too.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.980
That kind of Jutsu is called Nama-Nurui!

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:24.180
Look!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.420
A newly developed!

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.340
My new hero, Ninjutsu!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.500
You haven't grown at all, you bastard!

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:16.500
握りしめた夢がこぼれ落ちそうな時に限って思い出すの アイツのあの優しい顔 胸の奥がまた強くなれるの

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:28.420
ブッキラボーの心にファイヤー ぐっとくる明日を掴みたいんだ まだ見ぬ世界は怖くない 信じた未来でしょ ほらレッツトライ

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:29.860
数え切れない

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:47.750
My soul has been transformed into a rainbow

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:57.140
I'm aiming for the first prize

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.950
I can feel it

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.000
I believe in you

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:16.190
I thought you'd be surprised

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.910
Hehe, I've been training more art

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.240
That's exactly what I expected

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.060
It's exactly as planned

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.030
Planned?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:28.370
Heh, huh?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.050
As you can see, I polished it in a sparkly way!

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:43.110
Konohamaru, you're such a...

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.910
I'm not saying that I want you to teach me a new technique or anything!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:48.930
I don't have any ulterior motives or anything!

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.470
Hey, that's a bit too much.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:57.140
Well, this time, I'll teach you an amazing technique!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:58.520
Let's do it!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.840
So the plan is to clean up the luggage.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:06.490
Huh? That's the clothes Nii-chan was wearing?

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:08.800
As expected, I can't wear it anymore.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:11.310
I'm not going to throw it away.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.530
In other words, it's Nii-chan's treasure.

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:16.640
It's embarrassing to say that.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:29.340
The technique I'm going to teach you from now on is a level different from the technique there.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.630
What kind of amazing Ero Ninjutsu is it?

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:35.580
Please tell me!

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.440
First, it's a rotation.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.000
Oh!

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.740
Does this add movement?

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.630
And then the next one is power.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:45.860
It's a tricky one!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.070
And then, and then!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.480
And then the next one is!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:52.220
Oh!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.470
Is this the horn?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.670
Do you want to end it?

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.290
With an Ero point!

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:02.730
What are you talking about?

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.920
Huh? But it's Eronin Jutsu, right?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:08.880
No, it's even more amazing!

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:12.810
The Jutsu I'm going to teach you is Eto-Kunanido A-Rank!

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:19.880
It's a super-high-level ninja Jutsu that can turn the chakras, have power, and finish them off!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.000
It's Rasengan!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:30.760
Amazing!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:35.420
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.060
I told you it's okay!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:41.540
That's why I'm teaching you!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.050
Besides, this technique is okay even if you're an idiot!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:45.520
I see!

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.390
Hm? Idiot?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.080
This training consists of three stages in total.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.940
First, we'll use these water balloons.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.580
Water balloons?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.420
We'll use them and burn them!

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.820
How did you do it?

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.940
I explained it to you, didn't I?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.810
I did it like this, and then I broke it.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.180
So...

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:18.220
It's easy, isn't it?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.090
You can do it, Hamaru.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.060
I'm going to train with Sakura-chan from now on!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.650
Oh, come on!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.400
Don't be so spoiled, Konohamaru.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:36.820
Huh?

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.230
You have no choice but to learn it with your body.

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:47.130
Besides, I believe you can do it.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.590
Naruto-nii-chan...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:55.260
All right!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:56.920
I'm going to do this!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:59.520
I'll clear it before I meet you next time!

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:00.670
I wonder if I'll surprise you!

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:04.300
Do it like this!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:06.260
Gah!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:07.670
Do it like this!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.030
Baa!

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:09.270
Gah!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.110
Do it like this!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.780
Do it like this!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:25.260
What is this imagination?

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:28.530
The sand-hungry windfall was taken away by an organization called Akatsuki!

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.020
I just got a call!

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:34.350
K-Kahara...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.300
The criminal, Kakashi, will repeat his mission.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.350
Go to the village of the Sand Wanderer as soon as possible,

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.690
understand the situation, and deliver it to Konoha.

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.370
After that, follow the order of the Sand Wanderer,

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.990
and back them up!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:48.670
Yes!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:55.540
I'm waiting for you...

00:07:59.280 --> 00:07:59.420
Yes.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:00.700
Did something happen?

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.160
It's terrible!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.140
The sand school, the Wind Shadows,

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:05.540
were kidnapped by Akatsuki and the others!

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:08.210
The Wind Shadows?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.080
Your friend's?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.010
Yeah, and then,

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.020
Naruto-nii-chan went to support Roha.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:15.760
What?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:17.540
Isn't that amazing?

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:22.110
He was chosen for this kind of SQ mission early on!

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.530
Chiyo, he's just like us.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.930
I don't know if it's a scream or a bang.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:42.510
What are you talking about, Hamaru?

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:44.510
When did you guys start?

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:50.730
That's why you were screaming.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.260
Don't say that.

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.770
I was a little embarrassed.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:58.850
It's usually a scream and a bang.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:08:59.810
What is it?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.560
Hey, why don't you try moving away from that?

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.200
Huh?

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:05.800
What do you mean?

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.490
Because Naruto-nii-chan is a person of senses.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.050
Everyone is different, right?

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:12.830
Yeah.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.290
Hey, is there anything else?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:19.120
The first step is rotation.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:20.800
You have to learn it with your body.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.850
That's it!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.410
Konohamaru-kun!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.780
First, let's practice it!

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.360
Oh...

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:29.920
Oh...

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.300
I'm looking forward to working with you!

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:39.960
I don't know what's going on, but is it really okay?

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:45.260
Please! I have to do it for the sake of the truth!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.560
Okay, I got it! I'll buy your heart!

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.570
Come on!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:51.870
Oh!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:07.400
Thank you!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.370
If that's the case...

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:34.020
Hey!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.680
Ah, this is...

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:43.190
I can't use the rotation without it.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.340
Then...

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.370
Ah, I see.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:08.780
This won't hold my body!

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:10.330
That's right.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:11.840
So, did you get something?

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:13.400
Uh...

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.710
I knew it.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.250
Naruto-nii-chan, what else did you say?

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.320
I said I've taught you what you need.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.540
But, if I have to say what I've learned,

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:26.320
it's the Oiroki Jutsu.

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.330
No, wait!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:30.560
What's wrong?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.050
My Oiroge's Jutsu is called Namanorui, and it's no good!

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:38.960
That means, if I master更エロス, I might be able to clear it!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.420
Y-You're right, Hanaru-kun!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:48.750
But the problem is, how do I get to更エロス?

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:52.530
The key is, this is that man!

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.400
I see. A new way to learn a new technique.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.890
But I'm stuck on the wall.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:10.490
I need your help to overcome this.

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:15.910
That little Hamaru is so desperate.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.560
Then I have no choice but to answer with all my might.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.140
Let's cooperate with pleasure.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.740
So what do you want to know?

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:26.250
This is eros.

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.810
I want you to teach me more eros.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.040
Is that so?

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.720
What an eros!

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:34.620
What?

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:36.420
What do you mean, eros?

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:39.620
Naruto-nii-chan said...

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.030
If Jiraiya's grandpa is an open skewe,

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:47.790
then Ebisu-sensei is a muzzri skewe!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.870
Naruto-kun, that's too much!

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:53.310
You're the only one who can count on me!

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:56.030
I need to be a muzzri!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:57.770
Hey!

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:59.510
Gassu!

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:05.380
This hammer is Mutsuri's textbook!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.690
There's more here!

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:43.670
That eye...

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:47.330
Emotions that dwell in the eyes of a girl who is about to die...

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.290
The name of that emotion is...

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.460
KEMIBETSU

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.530
Wow, there are so many different kinds.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.060
Mutsuri has such a deep heart.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.340
I feel like my eyes are going to change when I see the teacher.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:11.200
But it's a problem that there are too many candidates.

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.520
Oh, how about this one?

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:20.560
It's a good idea, but...

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.820
All right.

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:22.740
Let's go!

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.940
The real Jutsu is from now on!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:44.820
That's right!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:56.660
The real Jutsu is from now on!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:13.910
Come to think of it, even when Naruto-nii-chan finished, the surface was swollen like this.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:16.760
Then, if you can make it even better...

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:18.360
Alright!

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:32.620
I did it!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:37.200
It's a little different, though.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:50.280
Okay, let's move on to the next training.

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:53.630
In the second stage, we'll use this.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.780
A rubber ball.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.240
That's right.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.810
And this...

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:04.900
And that's it!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:05.980
That again!?

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.320
I knew it!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.180
That's all you can do!?

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:14.220
That being said, Konohamaru, this technique...

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.870
You gotta learn it with your body!

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:17.030
What's that?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.680
You know it well.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.980
Actually, I wish I could just watch it a little bit.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:23.340
Huh?

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:26.530
You just got back, and you're on a mission again?

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:29.750
On this mission, the Scorpion Spy...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.860
I found out that he was at Orochimaru's place.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.270
Orochimaru...

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.910
That means...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.730
If I do well,

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.140
I might be able to get Sasuke's clue.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:42.300
I'll lure out the spy and catch him!

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:43.860
I'm just saying,

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.480
but I'm sure this mission is A-rank.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:47.310
That's all.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.010
After all, Nii-chan is amazing.

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:54.090
I'm the best!

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.940
I don't need your help!

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.720
Do your best!

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:05.200
I'll go first. I'll do this.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:09.630
It's still difficult, isn't it?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.710
The only thing that's not wrong is the power.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:18.700
The rubber is much harder and there's no water, so I can't feel it.

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:22.090
Then which one should I refer to next?

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.200
I think it's better to do this.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.520
No, it's this way.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.740
Hey, man.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:32.320
Mama told me there was a gap like this!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:35.270
If it's power, then this is all there is!

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.610
I think this person is strong.

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:41.430
The three of them are different, aren't they?

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:45.710
I see.

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.700
They lost their dignity as a city because of something.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:52.770
Yes. What should I do from now on?

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.260
Well, well.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.160
Anyone can make a mistake.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.240
You'll have a chance to get it back.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.520
Iruka-sensei...

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:06.990
Rather than that, let's sincerely support Konohamaru's growth now.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:08.150
Huh?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:16.160
Perfect timing! I was just talking about you two.

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:21.620
We have something we really want you to tell us, Ebisu-sensei!

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:23.440
To me?

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:28.650
That's good, Ebisu-sensei. It's a chance to regain your trust.

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:31.800
You guys!

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:33.980
No way!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:41.120
I want it!

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.860
I won't let you get away with it!

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:23.200
Is that so, Mr. Ebisu?

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:28.730
I understand, but it's called a ninja's hideout.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:28.950
Oh, my God.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.220
Although it is a magic, it is not something that can be activated without hesitation!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:37.310
It is the greatest effect to keep it closed to the last minute and release it at the right time!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.720
Close it to the last minute and release it at the right time?

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:43.640
Hmm?

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.610
Ebisu-sensei!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:46.730
Is something wrong?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.750
That's what it is!

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:49.590
Eh?

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:25.880
Naruto-nii-chan is far ahead of me.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.350
Even now, at this time, I'm trying to go ahead more and more.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.710
Thank you for watching.

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:07.890
You

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:25.800
I thought I was not alone

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.310
But the tears that flowed

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:34.470
The gloom that I bit

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:39.320
I was too weak to bring him back.

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:42.800
I'll use my wind chakra to surpass Sasuke this time!

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:48.000
That's my rival!

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:51.280
So, what do you think, Hamaru?

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:53.680
Next time on Naruto Shippuden,

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:55.340
Naruto's Rival!

